{"turn_id": "d15-t1", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "siamese_birnn_used", "text": "论文使用端到端的 Siamese 双向循环神经网络（Siamese bidirectional recurrent neural network）从可比较的维基百科多语文章中生成平行句，其中 Siamese BiRNN 编码器采用 GRU 作为激活函数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "nmt_evaluated", "text": "论文在所采集的数据集上评估了 NMT 和基于短语的 SMT 系统，并显示两者在英语–印地语和英语–泰米尔语低资源语言对上 BLEU 分数均有提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d15-t2", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "nmt_model_used", "text": "该论文使用端到端 Siamese 双向循环神经网络（Siamese bidirectional recurrent neural network），从 Wikipedia 的可比多语文章生成平行句对。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}, {"key": "nmt_encoder_gru", "text": "抽取平行句对时采用 Siamese BiRNN 编码器，并以 GRU 作为激活函数；该方法只需一个平行语料，不需要多步分类流程。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "nmt_end_to_end_no_features", "text": "该神经模型端到端学习，只用少量平行句对作为 bootstrap set，不需要特征工程，也不需要预先存在的翻译系统。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-2de814ddcd37609de37a6670"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-713c262decd20b8f527dcc24"}]}, {"key": "nmt_eval_bleu_with_without", "text": "论文通过比较使用与不使用抽取出的句对时机器翻译系统的 BLEU 分数，来验证该方法的有效性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-2de814ddcd37609de37a6670"}]}, {"key": "nmt_eval_language_pairs", "text": "实验针对英语–印地语（English–Hindi）和英语–泰米尔语（English–Tamil）两个低资源语言对。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}, {"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "nmt_eval_both_systems", "text": "与仅在这些语言对上收集的有限双语语料上训练相比，使用抽取获得的数据集提升了 NMT 和基于短语的 SMT 系统的 BLEU 分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}, {"key": "nmt_eval_bleu_gains", "text": "论文报告的 BLEU 分数百分比提升为：英语–泰米尔语 11.03%，英语–印地语 14.7%，归因于使用由该神经架构从可比语料中抽取的平行句对。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "nmt_motivation_oov", "text": "论文的动机之一是解决低资源机器翻译系统的高 OOV 率问题，通过利用互联网上不断增多的多语内容来丰富双语词典。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-2de814ddcd37609de37a6670"}]}, {"key": "nmt_prior_work_contrast", "text": "相关工作报告的多数方法使用预先存在的翻译系统对候选句对排序，或使用依赖词重叠等表层特征的统计机器学习最大熵分类器；论文称其深度神经网络模型不需要特征工程，也不需要预先存在的翻译系统。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-713c262decd20b8f527dcc24"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
